#: ../../source/how-to/troubleshoot.md:1
msgid "Troubleshoot common failures"
msgstr "排查常见故障"

#: ../../source/how-to/troubleshoot.md:3
msgid ""
"Use this page by searching for the complete error message. Fix the input or "
"selection described by the matching entry, then rerun `inspect` and `--dry-"
"run` before writing a new output directory."
msgstr "通过搜索完整错误消息来使用本页。修复匹配条目中描述的输入或选择范围，然后在写入新的输出目录之前重新运行 `inspect` 和 `--dry-run`。"

#: ../../source/how-to/troubleshoot.md:7
msgid "`Missing model.safetensors.index.json`"
msgstr "`Missing model.safetensors.index.json`"

#: ../../source/how-to/troubleshoot.md:9
msgid ""
"The input path is incorrect, or the checkpoint is not an indexed sharded "
"`safetensors` export."
msgstr "输入路径不正确，或者该 checkpoint 不是带索引的分片 `safetensors` 导出。"

#: ../../source/how-to/troubleshoot.md:12
msgid ""
"Check that the input directory is the exported model root and that the index"
" and all referenced shards are present together. A supported single-file "
"checkpoint can use `model.safetensors` instead of the index and shard set. "
"Rerun `inspect` after correcting the directory."
msgstr ""
"检查输入目录是否为导出的模型根目录，并确认索引和所有引用的分片同时存在。受支持的单文件 checkpoint 可以使用 "
"`model.safetensors`，而不是索引和分片集合。修正目录后重新运行 `inspect`。"

#: ../../source/how-to/troubleshoot.md:17
msgid "`No supported FP8/FP4 tensors were found`"
msgstr "`No supported FP8/FP4 tensors were found`"

#: ../../source/how-to/troubleshoot.md:19
msgid ""
"`convert` did not find recognized MXFP4 or strict 128 x 128 block FP8 "
"tensors. If the input is already BF16 or FP16, this result is expected; use "
"it as the floating-point baseline instead of running `convert`."
msgstr ""
"`convert` 未找到可识别的 MXFP4 或严格 128 x 128 块 FP8 张量。如果输入已经是 BF16 或 "
"FP16，这是预期结果；请将其作为浮点基线，而不是运行 `convert`。"

#: ../../source/how-to/troubleshoot.md:23
msgid ""
"For a low-precision input, verify the layout with `inspect` and confirm that"
" the scale tensors satisfy the supported format rules. Do not bypass an "
"unrecognized layout check."
msgstr "对于低精度输入，请用 `inspect` 验证布局，并确认 scale 张量满足受支持的格式规则。不要绕过无法识别的布局检查。"

#: ../../source/how-to/troubleshoot.md:27
msgid "`No weights selected`"
msgstr "`No weights selected`"

#: ../../source/how-to/troubleshoot.md:29
msgid ""
"No `--select` or `--select-name` option was provided, and the recipe does "
"not contain a `select` entry."
msgstr "未提供 `--select` 或 `--select-name` 选项，并且 recipe 中也不包含 `select` 条目。"

#: ../../source/how-to/troubleshoot.md:32
msgid ""
"Add at least one built-in selector or name rule. Recipe and CLI selectors "
"can be combined; use the [selector reference](../reference/selectors.md) for"
" the available built-in groups."
msgstr ""
"至少添加一个内置选择器或名称规则。Recipe 和 CLI 选择器可以组合使用；可用的内置分组请参见 [selector "
"reference](../reference/selectors.md)。"

#: ../../source/how-to/troubleshoot.md:36
msgid "`selectors did not match any supported tensors`"
msgstr "`selectors did not match any supported tensors`"

#: ../../source/how-to/troubleshoot.md:38
msgid ""
"The resolved selector set did not match any supported quantizable weights. "
"The CLI may report this as `The INT4 selectors did not match any supported "
"tensors` or `The INT8 selectors did not match any supported tensors`."
msgstr ""
"解析后的选择器集合没有匹配任何受支持的可量化权重。CLI 可能会将其报告为 `The INT4 selectors did not match any "
"supported tensors` 或 `The INT8 selectors did not match any supported "
"tensors`。"

#: ../../source/how-to/troubleshoot.md:42
msgid ""
"Run `inspect` first, check the model's actual weight names and recognized "
"groups, then rerun the same command with `--dry-run`. Do not infer selector "
"names from the model name alone."
msgstr "先运行 `inspect`，检查模型的实际权重名称和已识别分组，然后使用 `--dry-run` 重新运行同一命令。不要仅根据模型名称推断选择器名称。"

#: ../../source/how-to/troubleshoot.md:46
msgid "`unmatched quantized` is not `0`"
msgstr "`unmatched quantized` is not `0`"

#: ../../source/how-to/troubleshoot.md:48
msgid ""
"The checkpoint contains scaled byte weights whose layout is not a recognized"
" MXFP4 or block FP8 format. The tool refuses to guess the format."
msgstr "该 checkpoint 包含带 scale 的字节权重，但其布局不是可识别的 MXFP4 或块 FP8 格式。工具会拒绝猜测格式。"

#: ../../source/how-to/troubleshoot.md:51
msgid ""
"Do not publish the output or bypass this check. Add and validate support for"
" the source format first, or use a checkpoint whose low-precision layout is "
"recognized."
msgstr "不要发布该输出，也不要绕过此检查。请先添加并验证对源格式的支持，或使用低精度布局已被识别的 checkpoint。"

#: ../../source/how-to/troubleshoot.md:55
msgid "`in_features must be divisible by group_size`"
msgstr "`in_features must be divisible by group_size`"

#: ../../source/how-to/troubleshoot.md:57
msgid ""
"At least one selected layer's input dimension is not divisible by the "
"requested group size."
msgstr "至少有一个被选中层的输入维度不能被请求的 group size 整除。"

#: ../../source/how-to/troubleshoot.md:60
msgid ""
"Use `inspect` to review the selected layer shapes, then narrow the selection"
" or choose a group size supported by every selected layer and the target "
"runtime. Do not change the group size only to make the command pass without "
"checking runtime support."
msgstr ""
"使用 `inspect` 查看所选层的形状，然后缩小选择范围，或选择每个所选层和目标运行时都支持的 group size。不要只为让命令通过而更改 "
"group size，而不检查运行时支持。"

#: ../../source/how-to/troubleshoot.md:65
msgid "`INT4 pack-quantized storage requires in_features divisible by 8`"
msgstr "`INT4 pack-quantized storage requires in_features divisible by 8`"

#: ../../source/how-to/troubleshoot.md:67
msgid ""
"At least one selected layer does not satisfy the input-dimension requirement"
" for packed INT4 storage."
msgstr "至少有一个被选中层不满足 packed INT4 存储的输入维度要求。"

#: ../../source/how-to/troubleshoot.md:70
msgid ""
"Change the selection scope or use a quantization scheme whose storage "
"constraints fit the selected layers."
msgstr "更改选择范围，或使用存储约束适合所选层的量化方案。"

#: ../../source/how-to/troubleshoot.md:73
msgid "`channel strategy cannot be used for routed MoE`"
msgstr "`channel strategy cannot be used for routed MoE`"

#: ../../source/how-to/troubleshoot.md:75
msgid "W8A16 channel quantization is not valid for routed-expert weights."
msgstr "W8A16 channel 量化不适用于路由专家权重。"

#: ../../source/how-to/troubleshoot.md:77
msgid "Use W8A16 group for routed experts, or use the complete W8A8 policy:"
msgstr "对路由专家使用 W8A16 group，或使用完整的 W8A8 策略："

#: ../../source/how-to/troubleshoot.md:83
msgid "Do not use W8A16 channel for routed experts."
msgstr "不要对路由专家使用 W8A16 channel。"

#: ../../source/how-to/troubleshoot.md:85
msgid "`group_size must be omitted for channel strategy`"
msgstr "`group_size must be omitted for channel strategy`"

#: ../../source/how-to/troubleshoot.md:87
msgid ""
"Channel strategy does not accept `--group-size`. Remove the option for both "
"W8A16 channel and W8A8 channel commands."
msgstr "Channel 策略不接受 `--group-size`。对于 W8A16 channel 和 W8A8 channel 命令都应移除此选项。"

#: ../../source/how-to/troubleshoot.md:90
msgid "`The selection splits fused inference units`"
msgstr "`The selection splits fused inference units`"

#: ../../source/how-to/troubleshoot.md:92
msgid "A selector or exclusion matched only part of an inference-fused unit."
msgstr "某个选择器或排除规则只匹配了推理融合单元的一部分。"

#: ../../source/how-to/troubleshoot.md:94
msgid ""
"Use a built-in selector for the model family, or select the complete fused "
"pair or expert bank. Gate, up, and down projections in a fused expert module"
" must remain together, and routed expert banks must not be partially "
"selected. Rerun `--dry-run` and confirm the selected counts before "
"generation."
msgstr ""
"请使用该模型家族的内置选择器，或选择完整的融合对或专家权重组。融合专家模块中的 gate、up 和 down "
"投影必须保持在一起，路由专家权重组不得被部分选择。生成前重新运行 `--dry-run` 并确认选中数量。"

#: ../../source/how-to/troubleshoot.md:99
msgid "A model with `self_attn.indexer` fails during attention or MoE quantization"
msgstr "带有 `self_attn.indexer` 的模型在注意力或 MoE 量化期间失败"

#: ../../source/how-to/troubleshoot.md:101
msgid ""
"A broad `--select attention` or `--select moe` rule may include auxiliary "
"indexer weights that are not supported by the generic attention quantization"
" path."
msgstr "宽泛的 `--select attention` 或 `--select moe` 规则可能包含通用注意力量化路径不支持的辅助 indexer 权重。"

#: ../../source/how-to/troubleshoot.md:105
msgid "Exclude the indexer weights and rerun the dry-run:"
msgstr "排除 indexer 权重并重新运行空运行："

#: ../../source/how-to/troubleshoot.md:111
msgid ""
"The exclusion changes quantization selection only. Unselected floating-point"
" weights remain unchanged; unselected source low-precision weights follow "
"the configured unselected-weight policy."
msgstr "该排除规则只改变量化选择范围。未选中的浮点权重保持不变；未选中的源低精度权重遵循配置的未选中权重策略。"

#: ../../source/how-to/troubleshoot.md:115
msgid "`Fused routed-expert quantization is not supported for this model`"
msgstr "`Fused routed-expert quantization is not supported for this model`"

#: ../../source/how-to/troubleshoot.md:117
msgid ""
"The model configuration has no registered fused 3D expert layout, and the "
"complete `gate_up_proj` / `down_proj` shapes did not provide a consistent "
"axis order for automatic inference."
msgstr "模型配置没有注册的融合 3D 专家布局，并且完整的 `gate_up_proj` / `down_proj` 形状没有为自动推断提供一致的轴顺序。"

#: ../../source/how-to/troubleshoot.md:121
msgid ""
"First check that the expert banks are complete and inspect their shapes. If "
"the layout is still unknown, add and validate a model-specific `MoeLayout` "
"before quantizing. Do not apply another model's layout by assumption."
msgstr "先检查专家权重组是否完整并查看其形状。如果布局仍未知，请在量化前添加并验证模型专用的 `MoeLayout`。不要凭假设套用另一个模型的布局。"

#: ../../source/how-to/troubleshoot.md:125
msgid "`backend 'cuda' is unavailable`"
msgstr "`backend 'cuda' is unavailable`"

#: ../../source/how-to/troubleshoot.md:127
msgid "The local PyTorch environment cannot see CUDA."
msgstr "本地 PyTorch 环境无法发现 CUDA。"

#: ../../source/how-to/troubleshoot.md:129
msgid ""
"Check the NVIDIA driver, CUDA runtime, and PyTorch installation. On PPU or "
"Haiguang environments, use the backend name actually registered by the "
"installed PyTorch extension; do not infer the argument from the vendor name."
" You may use `--backend cpu` for conversion or non-calibrated functional "
"smoke tests, but CPU execution does not establish accelerator support or "
"performance."
msgstr ""
"检查 NVIDIA 驱动、CUDA 运行时和 PyTorch 安装。在 PPU 或海光环境中，请使用已安装 PyTorch "
"扩展实际注册的后端名称；不要根据厂商名称推断参数。你可以将 `--backend cpu` 用于转换或非校准功能冒烟测试，但 CPU "
"执行不能证明加速器支持或性能。"

#: ../../source/how-to/troubleshoot.md:136
msgid "`validate` returns `Valid`, but runtime loading fails"
msgstr "`validate` 返回 `Valid`，但运行时加载失败"

#: ../../source/how-to/troubleshoot.md:138
msgid ""
"`validate` checks artifact structure and metadata. It does not verify the "
"target runtime, device kernel, graph compilation, memory capacity, or "
"tensor-parallel configuration."
msgstr "`validate` 检查工件结构和元数据。它不会验证目标运行时、设备内核、图编译、内存容量或张量并行配置。"

#: ../../source/how-to/troubleshoot.md:142
msgid "Check all of the following in the target environment:"
msgstr "在目标环境中检查以下所有事项："

#: ../../source/how-to/troubleshoot.md:144
msgid ""
"the inference framework version supports the declared `compressed-tensors`, "
"GPTQ, AWQ, or AutoRound format;"
msgstr "推理框架版本支持声明的 `compressed-tensors`、GPTQ、AWQ 或 AutoRound 格式；"

#: ../../source/how-to/troubleshoot.md:146
msgid "the loader supports the model architecture and exact tensor names;"
msgstr "加载器支持该模型架构和确切的张量名称；"

#: ../../source/how-to/troubleshoot.md:147
msgid ""
"the hardware has kernels for the selected W4A16, W8A16, W8A8, GPTQ, AWQ, or "
"AutoRound path;"
msgstr "硬件具备所选 W4A16、W8A16、W8A8、GPTQ、AWQ 或 AutoRound 路径的内核；"

#: ../../source/how-to/troubleshoot.md:149
msgid ""
"tensor parallelism, KV cache, workspace, communication buffers, and "
"framework overhead fit in memory;"
msgstr "张量并行、KV cache、工作区、通信缓冲区和框架开销能够放入内存；"

#: ../../source/how-to/troubleshoot.md:151
msgid ""
"logs do not show unexpected fallback, dequantization, or graph compilation "
"failure."
msgstr "日志未显示意外回退、反量化或图编译失败。"

#: ../../source/how-to/troubleshoot.md:154
msgid ""
"For compressed-tensors output, review `quantization_manifest.json` and "
"`quantization_report.json` when present. For native GPTQ or AutoRound, "
"review `quantize_config.json` and the native tensors. For native AWQ, review"
" `quant_config.json` and the native tensors."
msgstr ""
"对于 compressed-tensors 输出，如存在 `quantization_manifest.json` 和 "
"`quantization_report.json`，请进行检查。对于原生 GPTQ 或 AutoRound，请检查 "
"`quantize_config.json` 和原生张量。对于原生 AWQ，请检查 `quant_config.json` 和原生张量。"

#: ../../source/how-to/troubleshoot.md:159
msgid "Calibration fails after generation starts"
msgstr "生成开始后校准失败"

#: ../../source/how-to/troubleshoot.md:161
msgid ""
"Check the calibration file shape, text column, sample count, sequence "
"length, model and tokenizer loading requirements, and backend availability. "
"Prefer a small local text, JSON, or JSONL file to separate data parsing "
"issues from dataset access issues."
msgstr ""
"检查校准文件形状、文本列、样本数量、序列长度、模型和 tokenizer 加载要求以及后端可用性。优先使用小型本地文本、JSON 或 JSONL "
"文件，以区分数据解析问题和数据集访问问题。"

#: ../../source/how-to/troubleshoot.md:166
msgid ""
"The `datasets` extra is required only for Hugging Face dataset names. "
"`--trust-remote-code` applies to Transformers model and tokenizer loading, "
"not to Hugging Face dataset loading. Calibrated GPTQ, AWQ, and AutoRound "
"execution requires an available backend and does not silently fall back to "
"CPU."
msgstr ""
"只有使用 Hugging Face 数据集名称时才需要 `datasets` extra。`--trust-remote-code` 适用于 "
"Transformers 模型和 tokenizer 加载，不适用于 Hugging Face 数据集加载。校准式 GPTQ、AWQ 和 "
"AutoRound 执行需要可用后端，不会静默回退到 CPU。"

#: ../../source/how-to/troubleshoot.md:172
msgid "What to record"
msgstr "需要记录的内容"

#: ../../source/how-to/troubleshoot.md:174
msgid "When reporting a failure, keep:"
msgstr "报告故障时，请保留："

#: ../../source/how-to/troubleshoot.md:176
msgid "the exact command line;"
msgstr "确切的命令行；"

#: ../../source/how-to/troubleshoot.md:177
msgid "the recipe file, if one was used;"
msgstr "recipe 文件（如果使用了）；"

#: ../../source/how-to/troubleshoot.md:178
msgid "source model name and revision;"
msgstr "源模型名称和修订版本；"

#: ../../source/how-to/troubleshoot.md:179
msgid "FlagOS-Compressor version or source commit;"
msgstr "FlagOS-Compressor 版本或源提交；"

#: ../../source/how-to/troubleshoot.md:180
msgid "backend and device;"
msgstr "后端和设备；"

#: ../../source/how-to/troubleshoot.md:181
msgid "`inspect`, dry-run, and `validate --json` output when available;"
msgstr "可用时的 `inspect`、空运行和 `validate --json` 输出；"

#: ../../source/how-to/troubleshoot.md:182
msgid "the relevant manifest/report or native method configuration."
msgstr "相关清单/报告或原生方法配置。"

#: ../../source/how-to/troubleshoot.md:184
msgid "The normal release path is:"
msgstr "正常发布路径为："

#: ../../source/how-to/troubleshoot.md:195
msgid ""
"FlagOS-Compressor owns the first four steps. Runtime and quality checks must"
" be completed in the deployment environment."
msgstr "FlagOS-Compressor 负责前四个步骤。运行时和质量检查必须在部署环境中完成。"

